# Curricula manifest for the iqabod expert bank (see dev-agent-convo/
# 04.arch-strategy + 05.genius-idea). THIS FILE LIVES ON THE LOCAL BOX
# ONLY - a tiny pointer table. Heavy data (corpus/vocab/weights) stays on
# the nodes in ~/iqabod-store/<name>/. Storage rule: pointer, not payload.
#
# Column meanings:
#   topic       - subject of the curriculum
#   grade       - ladder rung (conversation grades g1, g2, ...)
#   vocab_budget- max tokens the corpus author should reuse
#   teacher     - provider:model used to author the corpus
#   node        - linux | mac (which machine holds the weights)
#   path        - node-side dir: ~/iqabod-store/<name>/
#   status      - planned | training | passing | failing
#   report      - last training-report.txt row / verdict

CURRICULUM    | conv-g1            | topic=simple_greetings|grade=g1|vocab_budget=40|teacher=ollama:llama3:latest@mac|node=linux|path=~/iqabod-store/conv-g1|status=training|report=loss0.00056@lr0.1/100ep|eval=coherent_recite|unk=start_only|verdict=PASS_proof-of-learning
